;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; of lambda/lambda.ml the helpers the translation uses (bind, make_key, staticfail, is_guarded, patch_guarded,
;; next_raise_count), lambda/switch.ml (the Switcher: stores of actions, interval tests and jump tables, its cost
;; heuristics) and lambda/printlambda.ml's names of the primitives and kinds, whose notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The
;; OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Xavier Leroy, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;            Luc Maranget, projet Moscova, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;
